<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Palette U</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/images/main/logo.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/project.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('../components/header-new.ejs') %>
        <video class="hero-image" src="/assets/images/projects/paletteu/cover.mov" alt="Palette U" autoplay muted loop
            playsinline preload="metadata"></video>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="project-header-container">
                <div class="project-header">
                    <h4 class="tag" style="background-color: #FFA395;">2025</h4>

                    <h1>Palette U</h1>
                    <h3>A website to record your memories and store them in your 3D memory palace.</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="button-container">
                    <button class="button" onclick="window.location.href='https://youtu.be/i4X9Y0rxINE'"
                        target="_blank">View Video</button>
                    <button class="button" onclick="window.location.href='http://www.paletteu.com/'"
                        target="_blank">View Website</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="key-info">
                <div class="key-info-item">
                    <h3>TIMELINE</h3>
                    <p>Oct 2025 - Jan 2026</p>
                </div>
                <div class="key-info-item">
                    <h3>TEAM</h3>
                    <p>Personal Project</p>
                </div>
                <div class="key-info-item">
                    <h3>ROLE</h3>
                    <p>UIUX Designer & Project Manager & Full-Stack Developer & Marketing</p>
                </div>
                <div class="key-info-item">
                    <h3>SKILLS</h3>
                    <p>Three.js, HTML / CSS, JavaScript, Blender, Figma, Express.js, SQL</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Overview -->
            <section>
                <div class="overview-container">

                    <div class="overview-content-container">
                        <h2>OVERVIEW</h2>

                        <h3>As the final project of Networked Media course and Intro to Three.js course at NYU. Later
                            extended it to a complete personal project. My first three.js and backend development
                            project.
                        </h3>


                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">My roles and responsibilities included:</p>

                        <div class="overview-card-container">

                            <div class="overview-card" style="background-color: #FFC4BB;">
                                <div class="overview-card-title">
                                    <h4>01</h4>
                                    <h3>UIUX Design & 3D Modeling</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p>
                                    Designing the Visual and UIUX of the website and logo.
                                    Creating 3D models of the memory islands using Blender.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="overview-card" style="background-color: #FFECBA;">
                                <div class="overview-card-title">
                                    <h4>02</h4>
                                    <h3> Frontend Dev & Three.js</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p>Vanilla JavaScript and Three.js for the 3D visualization and interaction. And
                                    express.js, html, css for the website.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="overview-card" style="background-color: #E4F4C5;">
                                <div class="overview-card-title">
                                    <h4>03</h4>
                                    <h3>Backend Dev</h3>

                                </div>
                                <p>Using express.js, mysql to store the user data and the memory islands.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="overview-card" style="background-color: #C3E4FF;">
                                <div class="overview-card-title">
                                    <h4>04</h4>
                                    <h3>Research & Marketing</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p>Conducting user research and market research to understand the user needs and pain
                                    points. Creating marketing materials and promoting the project 2000+ views.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>


            <!-- Problem statement -->
            <div class="problem-statement-container">
                <div class="problem-statement" style="background: linear-gradient(150deg, #FFC4BB, #FFECBA);">
                    <h3>How to store memories in a more convenient and meaningful way?</h3>
                    <p><b>Target Audience:</b> <span style="margin-left: 10px;">Teenagers, Students, Young Adults, People who love journaling or diary.</span></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Problem research -->
            <section>

                <h2>PROBLEMS</h2>
                <h3>In this fast paced world, we are constantly exposed to new information and experiences. It is hard to remember everything. We need a way to store and organize our memories.</h3>
            </section>

            <!-- User Research -->
            <!-- <section>
                <h2>USER RESEARCH</h2>
                <h3>
                    Researched on existing memory related apps 
                </h3>
                <img class="project-wide-image" src="/assets/images/projects/paletteu/research1.png"
                    alt="design research" style="background-color: #f8f8f8;">
            </section> -->

            <!-- Market Research -->
            <section>
                <h2>MARKET RESEARCH</h2>
                <h3>
                    Researched on existing memory related apps 
                </h3>
                <img class="project-wide-image" src="/assets/images/projects/paletteu/research1.png"
                    alt="design research" style="background-color: #f8f8f8;">
            </section>

            <div class="problem-statement-container">
                <div class="problem-statement" style="background: linear-gradient(150deg, #E4F4C5, #C3E4FF);">
                    <h3><b style="margin-right: 10px;">Conclusion:</b> The product should provide a memory-palace experience that enables effortless storage while maintaining clear and meaningful organization.</h3>
                </div>
            </div>

